+<h2>Bug fixes</h2>
+<p>This list is likely incomplete.</p>
+<ul>
+
+<li><a href="https://bugs.freedesktop.org/show_bug.cgi?id=29162">Bug 29162</a> - mesa/darwin is severly broken</li>
