+OSMesa (off-screen)	implements OpenGL 2.1
+Windows/Win32		implements OpenGL 2.1
+Glide (3dfx Voodoo1/2)	implements OpenGL 1.3
+SVGA			unsupported
+Wind River UGL		unsupported
+DJGPP			unsupported
+GGI			unsupported
+BeOS			unsupported
+Allegro			unsupported
+D3D			unsupported
+</pre>
+
+</body>
+</html>
